       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SHOP-BILL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ITEM-PRICE PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 150.00.
       01 QUANTITY PIC 99 VALUE 3.
       01 TOTAL-BILL PIC 9(5)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE TOTAL-BILL =
               ITEM-PRICE * QUANTITY

           DISPLAY "ITEM PRICE: " ITEM-PRICE
           DISPLAY "QUANTITY: " QUANTITY
           DISPLAY "TOTAL BILL: " TOTAL-BILL

           STOP RUN.